":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","review_id":"KHYvCA-5pMpLwKOPf5BNEw","date":"2014-12-21T05:41:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482325315475464,"text_excerpt":"The prices and portions here just can't be beat. A 10 oz filet wrapped in bacon runs you $27 here and it's always a perfectly cooked and seasoned buttery piece of prime filet resting on a sizzling plate of garlic butter sauce. Anywhere else that 10 oz filet would run you much higher and I've done the meticulous menu research to prove it. If you can get it, ask for one of their intimate booths where thick carpet curtains close you into an old world dining environment. There is something mildly erotic to me about the whole idea of sipping on martinis inside a carpet cloaked, virtually sound proof booth while catering to your primal meat cravings. The servers were super nice and curteous wit..."},{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","review_id":"XU1GZEK1B7zHpcXLh6F1-Q","date":"2018-07-15T04:51:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9470519423484802,"text_excerpt":"This place was amazing. I came here for a birthday reservation and the woman who answered the phone was very pleasant. She asked if I was making a reservation for a special occasion, and made a note to add a candle to our dessert. The server didn't get the memo about the candle but that didn't matter after such a good meal. The place was packed when we arrived, and we watched the hostesses turn away a couple who came without a reservation. I highly recommend making a reservation, especially on weekends. There are nice booths with a privacy curtain that I requested upon reservation. The place is pretty loud when it's full so the curtain was a nice touch. We ordered the porterhouse for two,..."},{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","review_id":"CTQBiU17Ce-C-xuSrhEvLg","date":"2019-08-26T01:05:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.946170449256897,"text_excerpt":"This is an old-school long traditional steakhouse in New Orleans. The staff is super welcoming and very attentive without being annoying. I ordered the ribeye and it came out sizzling with the butter and the shoestrings fries. (See pictures). The ribeye was cooked the way I asked and very tasty. The shoestring fries were a bit undercooked but I'm sure they would have refried them had I asked. By the way, the steak is so big I can only eat half of it so I took most of the fries back home because I can re-fry them. Lol. They also came out with very warm freshly baked bread along with soft butter. My waitress Nancy was great. I chose to sit in one of their booths. I would highly recommend if..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","photo_id":"rhOKfM539c-jURDwMgZLww","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/rhOKfM539c-jURDwMgZLww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8854084014892578},{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","photo_id":"POXTGJM8a9WxRZCEcmhQjQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/POXTGJM8a9WxRZCEcmhQjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.884642481803894},{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","photo_id":"5-dXpvvIuRbjaoO-wI68HQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5-dXpvvIuRbjaoO-wI68HQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8448001146316528},{"business_id":"1ddqdY_piKp-abaZ-bGRSA","photo_id":"y4_97nRFTFeDRCDmri38WQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/y4_97nRFTFeDRCDmri38WQ.